WEBVTT

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.650
There sure are a lot more of these lately...

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.950
Hey, I'm back.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.530
I'm starting to sound like my dad.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.930
Sorry, this was all I could find today.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.060
There's not much food these days.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.250
Will it last two or three days, you think?

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.830
How's she doing? Asleep?

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.720
Then we have to make
sure not to wake her up.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.010
"Episode 19: The Bond 
Between Parent and Child"

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.460
Dad...

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:43.380
I followed the clues you
left me here to Dela Granto.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.390
There's no clocks or calendars in this world.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.680
But I think it's been about a year.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.280
Right, right.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.830
I know what you're asking.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.530
It's about the baby, right?

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.790
The stork brought it...

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.340
Well, of course that's a lie.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.760
This is Sayless and my daughter.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:19.260
A man and woman, all alone.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.760
Of course something's going to happen.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.370
Her name is Yu-No.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.600
Sayless gave it to her.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.490
You know, she said the same thing...

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.080
Y-Yu-No...

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.520
Is there some kind of strange connection?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:49.220
Sayless and I lived humbly and peacefully,
living off the land around us.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:57.880
I can't imagine a world
without Sayless and Yu-No now.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.980
To protect the family I care about...

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.550
I took up the job that Ailia used to do.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.900
They just keep coming...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.270
What are these things, really?

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.700
Don't mess with the kendo club.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:36.640
D-Divine Emperor...

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:38.660
It talked?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.310
No way.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.970
Kids sure do cry a lot.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.140
Here you go.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:01.780
She's so cute...

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.740
Oww!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.610
Don't bite it!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.520
Sorry.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.070
She looks like she's enjoying it.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:38.150
Hey, Yu-No.
Those boobs belong to me, too.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:43.270
I'm talking like my dad again.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.240
There's been many times this year
when I've thought of going back.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:02.390
Of course,

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.360
I haven't forgotten my promise to
bring back the psychite to Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:10.360
Before she died, Ailia told me
that the holy stones were

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.640
mined beyond the desert.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:17.070
Maybe those holy stones are psychite.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:22.500
To find out, I've tried to
cross the desert many times.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.790
I've tried everything I can think of.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.160
But the more I try,

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:36.370
the more I realize that escaping
from this harsh land is impossible.

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:44.140
Sayless...

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.660
You came from the imperial city, right?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.020
How did you cross the desert,

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.580
without a map or any food?

00:06:57.640 --> 00:07:00.630
Mother's guidance sent me
to the end of the world.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.700
To summon the goddess Grantia...

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.000
I don't understand,

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:13.950
but maybe that's what it's like when
a priestess hears the will of her goddess.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.720
Sorry, I shouldn't have asked.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.270
It doesn't matter what reasons you had.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.950
I'll always be there to protect you.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.190
Get them! After them! The nogard escaped!

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.700
She's getting away!

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:51.450
Stop! You won't get away!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.610
Hey, stop!

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.240
Surrender!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.790
Fire your arrows!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.870
Wait, damn you! Damn it!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.710
Damn it!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.030
Don't lose her!

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:12.620
Daddy!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.970
Daddy, are you taking a bath?

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.060
Maybe I'll join you!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.690
I'd love that, if you weren't my daughter.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.450
Yu-No grew up fast.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:29.860
A little too fast.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.080
Yu-No stood up on her own!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.370
She stood up on her own, Sayless!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.910
It was impossible to believe
how fast she grew up.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.250
She was running three months
after birth, and then...

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.800
Good morning, Yu-No.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.360
Mommy! Daddy!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:59.600
I love you! I love you both!

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.490
Yu-No talked! She talked, Sayless!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:09.570
--I love you! I love you!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:09.570
--Yu-No started talking just
six months after she was born.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:13.650
One year later, she seemed about four.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.450
And four years later, about sixteen.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.580
--She's going to be older
than me before long...

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.760
--I'm so full...
--She's going to be older
than me before long...

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.500
Hey, Daddy.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:34.780
Why won't you take a bath with me anymore?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.200
Do you not love me anymore?

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:43.100
Listen, where did you even get that idea?

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.550
If you love me, hug me!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.690
You always hug Mom and kiss her, right?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.400
Well, I do other things, too...

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:57.550
Hug!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.070
Hug!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:07.000
I'm so happy you and Mom are here for me.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:09.620
Hey, Yu-No.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.340
Do you want a friend?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.840
What's a friend? Can you eat it?

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:20.090
You can't. Friends are like, um...

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.320
Comrades.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.300
Comrades?

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.220
Yeah.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.630
For the stupid things,
the things that don't matter...

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.970
They're always there to laugh
with you and be with you.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:39.740
Daddy?

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.910
Um, what was I talking about?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.410
About eating friends.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.660
You don't eat them.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.910
Friends are basically...

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.850
You wait here, Yu-No.
It's dangerous, so don't move.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.980
Begone! Stay away from me!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.320
I knew it! They can talk!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.490
Daddy!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.870
Don't come any closer! Get away!

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:40.880
Daddy!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:45.090
I'll protect Yu-No, no matter what!

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:59.610
Just stay put!

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:00.770
Daddy, no!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.250
What's that lizard?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.400
My child...

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.090
No matter what it looks like...

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.910
It means more to me than anything else.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.300
Where did you come from?

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:29.200
We fled from the imperial city.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.010
Over the desert?

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.700
I'm sorry for being violent.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:40.280
But if you're a parent,
then you must understand...

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.990
I'm sorry... I couldn't protect you...

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.450
I wanted to see how you
looked when you grew up...

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:54.730
So live...

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:56.530
and be strong...

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.720
Did its mommy die?

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:13.730
Yeah.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.050
You're so cute!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.700
Yu-No, it'll bite you!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.120
No, I'm fine!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.210
Hey, Daddy!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.370
That look on your face...

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.720
I think I know what's coming, but...

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.730
I want to take it back with us!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.840
Thought so.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:45.970
It's okay, right?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.990
I know Mom will say yes.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.690
How will you feed it?

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.010
I can't give it my milk...

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.940
But maybe Mom can!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:57.980
No way!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.940
Those boobs are mine.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.320
Then what about your boobs?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.490
That's right.
They've been feeling full lately...

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.790
You know that's impossible!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:09.380
It's okay! I'll work hard!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.370
Okay, Kunkun?

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:13.590
Kunkun?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.780
What's that?

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.620
Its name!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.140
That's the sound it makes when it cries!

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.330
Not a lot of thought went into that, huh?

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:22.280
Just call it Spot or somethi--

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.660
Kunkun, let's go!

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.810
Let's race to the house!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:34.230
Oh well, I guess it's fine.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.430
Humans?

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.400
Hey! Hey!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:51.860
Can't you hear me?

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.570
Hey!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.540
What was that about?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:02.840
Please...

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.330
It's been forever since I've seen anyone.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.430
You can't sleep either, Sayless?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.230
What's wrong?

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:52.960
It's okay.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.700
I told you I'd protect you.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:06.310
Daddy... Mommy...

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.220
What's wrong, princess?

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.100
You can't sleep?

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.200
I wanted to be with you...

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.250
We're always together.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.420
And we always will be.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.300
Can I?

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:27.850
What do you think, Sayless?

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.470
You heard her.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.120
Come here.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.140
Okay!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.350
It's been so long since we've slept together!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:41.060
Yeah.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.690
What's wrong, Dad?

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.480
You look disappointed.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.730
I am not.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:49.610
I know! You want to be alone with Mom and...

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.110
What are you saying?

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.040
...eat lots of yummy food!

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.240
You got it.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.700
Hey, Mommy! Do you love Daddy?

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:02.760
I do too!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:06.390
I love him just as much as you!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.220
A strange human at the border?

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:21.090
Indeed. We happened to find him
while pursuing livestock.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.550
He seemed to be living there.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:27.580
Only Ailia the knight
should be at the border now.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.150
What shall we do, Your Highness?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.750
There is the matter of the priestess as well.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.420
Investigate immediately.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:37.330
As you wish.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.200
Look, look!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.370
It's so cute!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.660
Yeah, it's a little cuter I guess.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:52.450
That was dangerous!

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.380
Mommy!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:57.760
How many wild strawberries should I bring?

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.340
I see.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:12.300
Okay.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.860
I'll go and play with Kunkun!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:20.370
Get our lunches and come after me, okay!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.700
Let's go, Kunkun!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.700
They're best friends now.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:36.600
I'll go bring us a bunch back,
so look forward to it, okay?

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:46.810
Hey, if you run around so much,
you'll be tired later!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.720
I'm fine!

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.900
Oh, here's a whole bunch.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.360
That's a lot.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.740
They look yummy!

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.210
Should we eat a few?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.940
Don't tell Mommy!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.030
Again?

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:12.610
Hide, Yu-No!

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.200
K-Kill you...

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.630
So they can talk!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.970
Hey, why do you come here?!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.590
Shut up!

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:29.840
Damn it!

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.760
So there's no talking to him, huh?

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:39.670
I-Imperial city...

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.000
Imperial city?

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.260
They came from there too?

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.520
You're still hungry?

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:59.110
If I ask them...

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:01.860
maybe I can cross the desert.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:06.250
But what about my life here...

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.010
What about Sayless and Yu-No?

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.920
What's wrong, Yu-No?

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.200
Constipated?

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.560
Did something happen?

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.960
Um, Daddy...

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.280
I want to tell you something.

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:36.910
Anything, princess.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:41.290
My heart feels like it's fluttering...

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.190
Did you fall in love with a prince?

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.220
No.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.200
Then what is it?

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.030
No, it's nothing.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.070
Sorry.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.870
He really does eat a lot.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.940
The sun will go down before he's done.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.540
That's...

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.080
They came back!

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:24.410
Yu-No, let's go.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:27.880
Wait. He's still hungry.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.810
I'll go alone then.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:32.850
Be careful on your way back.

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:34.490
Okay...

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:44.860
Find out for sure!

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:47.410
Please don't resist!

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.030
Hold her down!

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:51.580
Priestess or not, the rules are absolute!

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:52.890
Sayless!

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.070
So it was a man!

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:56.740
Takuya!

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:58.660
She's speaking, too!

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:03.020
Takuya, run!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:41.570
"Episode 20: Into the Rafaelo Desert"

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:38.960
Episode 20: "Into the Rafaelo Desert."
